From hpages at fhcrc.org  Fri Mar 13 04:47:07 2009
From: hpages at fhcrc.org (=?ISO-8859-1?Q?Herv=E9_Pag=E8s?=)
Date: Thu, 12 Mar 2009 20:47:07 -0700
Subject: [BioC] building a new annotation
