> > > > background="antigenomic",
> > > > normalize=T, option="transcript", exonlevel="core")
> > > >
> > > >
> > > > Alternatively you can use function "express()" to compute RMA:
> > > > a, stepwise:
> > > > ## 1.step: background - rma
